  "mechanism": "read_fallible copies the prefix and returns (PageFault, copied); the error conversion drops copied; Vmo::read propagates the error after the copy; InodeHandle advances the offset only on Ok, so the next read re-delivers the prefix.",
  "sites": [
    "ostd/src/mm/io/mod.rs::VmReader::read_fallible",
    "kernel/core/src/error.rs::From<(ostd::Error, usize)>::from",
    "kernel/core/src/vm/page_cache/vmo/mod.rs::Vmo::read",
    "kernel/core/src/fs/file/inode_handle.rs::InodeHandle::read"
  ],
